        AG-VPReID 2025: Aerial-Ground Video-based Person Re-identification Challenge Results
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Nguyen%2C+K">Kien Nguyen</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Fookes%2C+C">Clinton Fookes</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sridharan%2C+S">Sridha Sridharan</a>, 
      
