    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Refining Czech GEC: Insights from a Multi-Experiment Approach
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Pechman%2C+P">Petr Pechman</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Straka%2C+M">Milan Straka</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Strakov%C3%A1%2C+J">Jana Straková</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=N%C3%A1plava%2C+J">Jakub Náplava</a>
      
